message: >-
  The primary content of this repository is the theoretical notes and
  derivations under docs/ (see preferred-citation below); the Python
  source under src/ implements and numerically verifies them. If you use
  or build on this work, please cite it as below.
title: "WPMW: notes, derivations, and code for a compensated Liouville algorithm for quantum dynamics via signed particles"
